	  This should've included in the previous MR
	  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/merge_requests/987
	  already, but missed.
	  Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/merge_requests/2324>

