2020-06-23 12:41:27 -0700  Julien <jisorce@oblong.com>

	* docs/plugins/gst_plugins_cache.json:
	* ext/gs/.clang-format:
	* ext/gs/README.md:
	* ext/gs/gstgs.cpp:
