	  profile for screen content coding extension in the caps filter
	  Example:
	  gst-launch-1.0 videotestsrc ! video/x-raw,format=NV12 ! msdkh265enc
	  low-power=1 ! video/x-h265,profile=screen-extended-main ! fakesink
