	* sys/d3d11/plugin.c:
	  d3d11videosink: Assign primary rank
	  d3d11videosink has an advantage over d3dvideosink, such as
	  * Zero-copy playback with d3d11 decoders
	  * HDR rendering with 10-bit format/swapchain support
	  * UWP support
