	* ext/hls/meson.build:
	  ext/hls/meson.build: fix dependency logic
	  Currently, if one was to set -Dhls-crypto to either libgcrypt or openssl
	  instead of auto, the following lines would fail because hls_crypto_dep is not
	  yet set:
