	  gst/rtpmanager/: Also keep track of the first buffer timestamp together with the first
	  Original commit message from CVS:
	  * gst/rtpmanager/gstrtpbin.c: (gst_rtp_bin_associate),
	  (gst_rtp_bin_sync_chain):
